  "name": "SafeMobile: Chain-level Jailbreak Detection and Automated Evaluation for Multimodal Mobile Agents",
  "notes": "The reviewed evaluation uses Android emulation and a specific MobileSafetyBench-derived setup. Its judge and score threshold are evaluator choices, not universal safety measurements, and its task population is not the whole later MobileSafetyBench corpus. No results were reproduced. Basis: complete retained abstract and source-reviewed sections of the exact-version paper (II.B Defense objective; III Chain-level guard and GPTJudge; IV.B Evaluation setup; V.D Judge validity); not an entire-paper reading or reproduction claim.",
  "published_at": "2025-07-01",
  "relations": [],
  "review_status": "curated",
  "scope": "core",
  "summary": "Studies chain-level risk detection for mobile multimodal agents and a language-model-assisted evaluator, assessing safety interventions together with functional preservation.",
